                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:36,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:39,325</end-time>
                <translation>在这三代人的时间里
この三世代の間に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="113" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:39,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:43,275</end-time>
                <translation>生产出了巨大的人类群体
人間の巨大な塊が生産され</translation>
