            <t id="" vertical="0" index="253" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:32,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:37,650</end-time>
                <translation>平均人平庸的精神以平等的名义
平均人の凡庸な精神が平等の名の下に</translation>
