                <start-time>00:16:05,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:06,520</end-time>
                <translation>就会觉得不舒服
気持ちが悪い</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="287" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:06,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:08,320</end-time>
                <translation>简直就像这群沙丁鱼</translation>
                <original>まるでこのイワシの群れが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="288" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:08,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:10,000</end-time>
                <translation>一直在流动一样</translation>
                <original>ずっと流れているような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
