                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="292" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:20,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:21,860</end-time>
                <translation>难道这“平均人”</translation>
                <original>平均人っていうのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="293" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:21,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:24,975</end-time>
                <translation>不是正在不断地涌现出来么？</translation>
                <original>どんどんどんどんと出てきているんじゃないのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="294" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:24,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:26,650</end-time>
                <translation>就在不久前
少し前ね</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="295" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:26,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:30,575</end-time>
                <translation>在人前拿出手机还会有种羞耻感</translation>
                <original>人前でスマホを出す恥ずかしさみたいなのあったんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="296" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:30,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:35,550</end-time>
                <translation>但现在虽然不至于说在电车里不拿出来会羞耻</translation>
                <original>だけど今電車の中で出してない恥ずかしさとまでは言わないけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="297" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:35,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:38,040</end-time>
                <translation>就是过了某个程度之后</translation>
                <original>なんかこうある程度のとこを越えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="298" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:38,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:40,720</end-time>
                <translation>理所当然的事情一下子全部翻转过来的感觉</translation>
                <original>当たり前が一気に全部裏返る感じっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="299" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:40,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,525</end-time>
                <translation>而且那还比较</translation>
                <original>それも割とその</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="300" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:42,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:45,075</end-time>
                <translation>瞬间就变成了那样的世界呢</translation>
                <original>瞬時にそういう世の中になったよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="301" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:45,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:46,975</end-time>
                <translation>感觉速度也在提升</translation>
                <original>速度も上がっているような気もする</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="302" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:46,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:48,120</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来</translation>
                <original>そうなってくると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="303" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:48,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:50,375</end-time>
                <translation>那些说“我不用智能手机”的人</translation>
                <original>俺はスマホ持たないんだっていうやつが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="304" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:50,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:51,800</end-time>
                <translation>就会让人觉得烦人</translation>
                <original>鬱陶しくなってきたりするんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="305" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:51,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:52,940</end-time>
                <translation>也许是这样</translation>
                <original>そうかもしれないです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="306" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:52,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:54,025</end-time>
                <translation>怎么用不了啊</translation>
                <original>つかねえじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="307" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:54,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:55,825</end-time>
                <translation>你就不能跟大家一样好好用吗</translation>
                <original>みんなとちゃんと同じようにやってくれよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="308" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:55,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:57,320</end-time>
                <translation>这种情绪就会涌上来</translation>
                <original>っていう気分が湧いてきますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="309" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:57,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:59,080</end-time>
                <translation>哇 那我真的很过分</translation>
                <original>うわー俺本当申し訳ないけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="310" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:59,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:02,475</end-time>
                <translation>我朋友里有个坚持用功能机的人</translation>
                <original>自分の友達にガラ系主義の人がいるんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="311" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:02,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:04,950</end-time>
                <translation>我跟他说联系太麻烦了 别用了</translation>
                <original>連絡がめんどくせえからやめてくれって言ってるね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="312" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:04,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:06,440</end-time>
                <translation>你的坚持倒是无所谓</translation>
                <original>そのお前のこだわりは結構だけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="313" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:06,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:08,160</end-time>
                <translation>但会给周围人添麻烦 我这么说了</translation>
                <original>周りに迷惑だみたいなこと言っちゃってるね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="314" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:08,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:09,435</end-time>
                <translation>确实会这样</translation>
                <original>そうなりますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="315" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:12,310</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:16,175</end-time>
                <translation>没有“自己就是这样”的根基</translation>
                <original>自分はこうなのだという根っこや</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="316" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:16,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:21,350</end-time>
                <translation>也没有对超越自身之物的异样感念</translation>
                <original>自分を超えたものに対する異形の念を持たず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="317" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:21,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:23,225</end-time>
                <translation>周围人说这个好</translation>
                <original>周囲がこれがいい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="318" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:23,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:26,020</end-time>
                <translation>就立刻随波逐流的大众</translation>
                <original>といえばすぐに流されていく大衆</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="319" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:29,195</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,375</end-time>
                <translation>他们像气球一样不抗拒时代的浪潮</translation>
                <original>彼らは風船のように時代の波に抗うことなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="320" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:34,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:38,000</end-time>
                <translation>如果又刮起别的风 就会飘向那边</translation>
                <original>また別の風が吹いたらそちらへと流れていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="321" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:40,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:42,475</end-time>
                <translation>这种无根浮萍般的大众</translation>
                <original>そんな根無し草の大衆は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="322" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:42,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:45,250</end-time>
                <translation>同时也过分相信自己的能力
同時に自分の能力を過信し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="323" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:45,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:48,500</end-time>
                <translation>具有傲慢自大的性质</translation>
                <original>慢心するという性質も持っているのだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="324" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:48,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:50,020</end-time>
                <translation>奥尔特加说道</translation>
                <original>オルテガは言います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="325" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:52,395</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:56,700</end-time>
                <translation>人性中最矛盾的一种形态是</translation>
                <original>人間のせいの最も矛盾した形態は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="326" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:56,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:00,950</end-time>
                <translation>《傲慢的少爷》这种形态</translation>
                <original>慢心した坊ちゃんという形態である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="327" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:00,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:03,425</end-time>
                <translation>称之为《傲慢的少爷》</translation>
                <original>慢心した坊ちゃんとは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="328" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:03,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:08,475</end-time>
                <translation>我想可以让人清楚地看出这是极其异常的东西</translation>
                <original>とてつもなく異常なものだということがはっきりわかると思う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="329" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:08,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:10,700</end-time>
                <translation>因为</translation>
                <original>なぜならば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="330" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:10,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:18,105</end-time>
                <translation>他生来如此就是为了让自己为所欲为的人</translation>
                <original>彼は自分でしたい放題のことをするために 生まれをした人間だからである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="331" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:20,905</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:24,825</end-time>
                <translation>大众没有意识到自己的平庸</translation>
                <original>大衆は自らの凡庸さに気づかず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="332" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:24,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:26,825</end-time>
                <translation>过分相信自己的能力</translation>
                <original>その能力を過信して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="333" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:26,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:29,520</end-time>
                <translation>误以为自己什么都能做到</translation>
                <original>何でもできると勘違いしています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="334" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:31,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:33,825</end-time>
                <translation>奥尔特加将他们称为</translation>
                <original>オルテガは彼らを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="335" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:33,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:37,850</end-time>
                <translation>安于自己是多数派这一事实的</translation>
                <original>自分が多数派だということにあぐらを描いている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="336" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:37,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:41,200</end-time>
                <translation>傲慢的少爷</translation>
                <original>慢心した坊ちゃんと呼ぶのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="337" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:44,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:47,625</end-time>
                <translation>哎呀 说得可真不留情面</translation>
                <original>いやーってすりまくりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="338" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:47,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:50,100</end-time>
                <translation>语气相当重啊</translation>
                <original>だいぶ強めに言ってますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="339" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:50,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:54,250</end-time>
                <translation>首先 他们误以为自己能独占正确</translation>
                <original>まず正しさを所有できると勘違いしている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="340" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:54,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,950</end-time>
                <translation>对自己的能力和理性毫无怀疑
自分の能力や理性に対する懐疑がない</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="341" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:57,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:00,380</end-time>
                <translation>是自以为完美的愚人
自分を完全だと思う愚か者</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="342" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:00,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:04,500</end-time>
                <translation>而且对超越自己的存在毫无敬畏之心</translation>
                <original>で自分を超えた者への畏敬の念がない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="343" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:04,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:06,850</end-time>
                <translation>在历史长河中</translation>
                <original>まあ歴史の中でですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="344" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:06,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:10,275</end-time>
                <translation>对那些经过漫长时间积淀而成的事物</translation>
                <original>ずっと長く作られてきたものというものに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="345" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:10,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,925</end-time>
                <translation>毫无敬畏之心</translation>
                <original>畏敬の念がなくですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="346" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:11,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:15,075</end-time>
                <translation>并且觉得根据自己的方便一下子全部改变也无妨</translation>
                <original>そして自分たちの都合によって一気に変えてしまっていいんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="347" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:15,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:18,440</end-time>
                <translation>这种意识非常强烈</translation>
                <original>そういうような感覚が非常に強いと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="348" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:18,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:20,475</end-time>
                <translation>然而历史之中</translation>
                <original>しかし歴史の中には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="349" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:20,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:22,175</end-time>
                <translation>蕴含着各种各样的智慧</translation>
                <original>非常にいろんな英知があって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="350" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:22,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:24,320</end-time>
                <translation>果然 无论多数派怎么说</translation>
                <original>やっぱりいくら多数派が言っても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="351" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:24,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:25,950</end-time>
                <translation>不能改变的东西</translation>
                <original>変えちゃいけないものとかっていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="352" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:25,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:27,900</end-time>
                <translation>应该有很多吧</translation>
                <original>たくさんあるんじゃないのかっていう風に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="353" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:27,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:30,475</end-time>
                <translation>奥尔特加是这样认为的</translation>
                <original>オルデが考えているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="354" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:30,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:31,900</end-time>
                <translation>其魅力之一
魅力の一つが</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="355" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:31,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:35,475</end-time>
                <translation>就在于“傲慢的少爷”这个命名品味</translation>
                <original>この慢心した坊ちゃんというネーミングセンスなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="356" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:35,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:38,775</end-time>
                <translation>这个命名方式非常易懂</translation>
                <original>このネーミングセンスはとても分かりやすいんだよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="357" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:38,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:41,625</end-time>
                <translation>“少爷”这个词所包含的任性</translation>
                <original>坊ちゃんというところのわがままさや</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="358" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:41,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:45,080</end-time>
                <translation>以及实际行动还远远跟不上</translation>
                <original>現実の行動がまだまだ伴っていないんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="359" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:45,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:48,260</end-time>
                <translation>这些含义都被浓缩其中</translation>
                <original>っていうことがぎゅっと凝縮されてて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="360" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:48,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:49,450</end-time>
                <translation>幽默感到了</translation>
                <original>ユーモア届く</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="361" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:49,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:51,440</end-time>
                <translation>幽默感传达得到 包含在里面了</translation>
                <original>入っているんだってユーモア届く入っているんだって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="362" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:51,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:52,450</end-time>
                <translation>确实包含在里面呢</translation>
                <original>入ってますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="363" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:55,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:58,300</end-time>
                <translation>专家与大众
専門家と大衆</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="364" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:00,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:05,025</end-time>
                <translation>奥尔特加写道 以科学家为首的专家们</translation>
                <original>オルテガは科学者をはじめとする専門家たちこそが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="365" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:05,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:10,120</end-time>
                <translation>在现代已经变成了大众式的人</translation>
                <original>現代では大衆的人間に変わってしまったと書いています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="366" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:14,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:17,175</end-time>
                <translation>现代的科学家
現代の科学者は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="367" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:17,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:22,400</end-time>
                <translation>就成了大众式人类的原型</translation>
                <original>大衆的人間の原型だということになる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="368" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:22,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:25,975</end-time>
                <translation>过去 人类
昔は人間を</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="369" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:25,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:29,450</end-time>
                <translation>可以简单地分为有知者和无知者
知者と無知のもの</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="370" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:29,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:33,375</end-time>
                <translation>或者相当有知的人与</translation>
                <original>あるいはかなりの知者と</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="371" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:33,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:36,650</end-time>
                <translation>相对而言无知的人</translation>
                <original>どちらかといえば無知である人に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="372" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:36,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:39,825</end-time>
                <translation>可以简单地划分</translation>
                <original>単純に分けることができた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="373" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:39,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:47,175</end-time>
                <translation>然而专家却无法归入这两个范畴中的任何一个</translation>
                <original>ところが専門家はこの二つの範疇のどちらにも入れることができない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="374" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:49,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:56,875</end-time>
                <translation>因为他在原则上可以对自己专业领域之外的事情一无所知</translation>
                <original>彼は自分の専門領域にないことを知らない建前だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="375" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:56,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:59,441</end-time>
                <translation>所以不是有知者</translation>
                <original>知者ではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="376" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:59,441</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:03,475</end-time>
                <translation>但他又是科学家</translation>
                <original>しかし彼は科学者であって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="377" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:03,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:08,725</end-time>
                <translation>对自己专业中极其微小的部分非常了解</translation>
                <original>自分の専門の微小な部分をよく知っているから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="378" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:08,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:13,275</end-time>
                <translation>所以他并非无知 他</translation>
                <original>無知ではない彼は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="379" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:13,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:18,775</end-time>
                <translation>或许应该被称为“无知的知者”</translation>
                <original>無知な知者であるとでも言うべきであろうが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="380" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:18,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:20,896</end-time>
                <translation>这件事非常严重</translation>
                <original>ことは重大である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="381" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:23,646</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:25,425</end-time>
                <translation>什么意思？什么意思？</translation>
                <original>どういうことどういうこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="382" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:25,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:28,900</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得这是奥尔特加非常有趣的地方</translation>
                <original>これオルテガの非常に面白いところだと思うんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="383" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:28,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:33,075</end-time>
                <translation>科学家不仅仅是指做实验的理科人士</translation>
                <original>科学者というのは単に実験をやっている理系の人だけじゃなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="384" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:33,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:37,000</end-time>
                <translation>而是泛指所有学者 也包括从事人文科学或社会科学研究的人</translation>
                <original>学者全般ですね人文科学とか社会科学とかをやっている人もいるんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="385" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:37,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,780</end-time>
                <translation>他在这里把专家</translation>
                <original>これ専門家はやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="386" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:38,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:41,725</end-time>
                <translation>反过来定义为大众的典型</translation>
                <original>大衆の典型であるというふうにひっくり返すんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="387" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:41,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:43,900</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 所谓专家</translation>
                <original>つまり専門家っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="388" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:43,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:47,750</end-time>
                <translation>我们会想 他为什么会犯错呢</translation>
                <original>なんで彼は間違えるんだろうというふうに考えるんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="389" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:47,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:50,475</end-time>
                <translation>那并不是因为他不懂专业的事情</translation>
                <original>それは専門のことを知らないからじゃないんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="390" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:50,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:54,500</end-time>
                <translation>他认为那是因为他们只了解自己的专业领域</translation>
                <original>専門のことしか知らないからだというふうに彼は考えているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="391" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:54,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:57,200</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 这个世界极其复杂</translation>
                <original>つまり世の中はものすごい複雑ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="392" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:57,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:01,300</end-time>
                <translation>各种事情相互交织 股价等各种事物都在变动</translation>
                <original>いろんなことが絡み合って株価とかいろんなものが推移しているんだけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="393" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:01,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:03,600</end-time>
                <translation>比如经济学家只懂经济</translation>
                <original>例えば経済学者は経済のことしか知らない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="394" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:03,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,125</end-time>
                <translation>某某学者只懂某某领域</translation>
                <original>何々学者は何々のことしか知らない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="395" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:06,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:09,644</end-time>
                <translation>只了解那些</translation>
                <original>そのある種の断片的なことだけしか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="396" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:09,644</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:13,125</end-time>
                <translation>某种片面事物的专家群体</translation>
                <original>専門的に知らない人間の群れになってしまっていると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="397" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:13,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:18,050</end-time>
                <translation>已经无法把握这个综合而复杂的社会和人了</translation>
                <original>この総合的で複雑な社会や人間というものを捉えることができなくなっている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="398" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:18,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:19,475</end-time>
                <translation>人是很复杂的</translation>
                <original>人間ってややこしいですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="399" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:19,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:21,975</end-time>
                <translation>明明喜欢却故作冷淡</translation>
                <original>なんか好きなのにツンとしてみたりとかですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="400" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:21,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:24,250</end-time>
                <translation>明明尊敬却出言贬低</translation>
                <original>尊敬しているのにけなしたりとかですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="401" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:24,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:26,575</end-time>
                <translation>对于如此复杂的动物</translation>
                <original>ややこしいそういう動物を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="402" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:26,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:29,300</end-time>
                <translation>失去了综合把握的视野</translation>
                <original>ちゃんと総合的に捉えるビジョンがなくなる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="403" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:29,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,250</end-time>
                <translation>所以他说这是“无知的智者” 这一点很有意思</translation>
                <original>だから無知な知者だって言っているのは面白いところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="404" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:33,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,150</end-time>
                <translation>所谓智者 是指精通专业的人</translation>
                <original>知者っていうのは専門のことをよく知っている人ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="405" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:36,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,650</end-time>
                <translation>但对于整个世界、广博的修养</translation>
                <original>けれども世界全般とか広い教養とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="406" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:39,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:45,075</end-time>
                <translation>或者某种对普通民众的看法等</translation>
                <original>あるいはある種の庶民的な人間に対するものの見方とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="407" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:45,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,000</end-time>
                <translation>在这些方面却极其无知</translation>
                <original>そういうものについては非常に無知である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="408" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:48,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,220</end-time>
                <translation>所以 对于这种只懂专业的人</translation>
                <original>だからそういうある種の専門しか知らない人間の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="409" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:52,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,475</end-time>
                <translation>他在这里批判了他们容易狂热的特点</translation>
                <original>熱狂しやすさみたいなものをここで批判し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="410" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:55,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,300</end-time>
                <translation>反过来指出“你们才是大众”</translation>
                <original>あんたたちこそ大衆ですよっていうふうにひっくり返しているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="411" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:00,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:02,200</end-time>
                <translation>听了刚才的解说</translation>
                <original>いやなんか今の解説聞いて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="412" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:02,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:05,950</end-time>
                <translation>让我感受到了这本书的部分有趣之处</translation>
                <original>この本の面白さの一部が分かったなと思うのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="413" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:05,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,750</end-time>
                <translation>那就是“你们觉得自己学了科学就比别人了不起”</translation>
                <original>あなたたちだって科学を勉強している自分は人より偉いって思っているのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="414" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:10,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,225</end-time>
                <translation>“这是天大的谬误”</translation>
                <original>とんでもない飛躍ですよっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="415" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:13,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:16,000</end-time>
                <translation>- 敢说出这样的话呢 - 是的</translation>
                <original>-ことを言い出すわけですね　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="416" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:16,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:19,575</end-time>
                <translation>他谈到了存在于每个人身上的大众性</translation>
                <original>どの人の中にもある大衆性とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="417" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:19,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:24,000</end-time>
                <translation>以及大众化的征兆</translation>
                <original>大衆化の兆しみたいなことを言っているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="418" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:24,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,550</end-time>
                <translation>我认为是这样</translation>
                <original>そうだと思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="419" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:25,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,280</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 我们与这一切绝非毫无关系</translation>
                <original>つまりここから私たちは全く無縁ではないですよと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="420" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:29,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,125</end-time>
                <translation>这是大家的问题</translation>
                <original>みんなの問題ですよと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="421" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:31,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,329</end-time>
                <translation>那或许正是我自身的问题</translation>
                <original>それは他ならない私自身の問題かもしれない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="422" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:34,329</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:35,925</end-time>
                <translation>这种自我怀疑的念头</translation>
                <original>っていう自己懐疑の念っていうのも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="423" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:35,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:39,550</end-time>
                <translation>我想奥尔特加心中大概也是有的吧</translation>
                <original>おそらくオールデガの中にはあるんじゃないかなと思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="424" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:39,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,200</end-time>
                <translation>接下来会触及哪一方面 真令人期待啊</translation>
                <original>この先もちょっとどっちに触れていくのか楽しみですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="425" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:42,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:45,160</end-time>
                <translation>好的 中岛老师 接下来也请多关照</translation>
                <original>はい中島さんまたよろしくお願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="426" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:45,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:46,180</end-time>
                <translation>今天非常感谢</translation>
                <original>今日はありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="427" time="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:46,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:47,830</end-time>
                <translation>（齐声）非常感谢</translation>
                <original>(一斉に)ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
